{"nodes": [{"id": "specs_2026_08_28_charge_reference_design_spec", "label": "Spec Charge de r\u00e9f\u00e9rence par document", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-28-charge-reference-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "specs_2026_08_28_charge_reference_design_cascade_duree", "label": "Cascade Duree_Force \u2192 Duree_Zone \u2192 Duree_Projet", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "La charge de r\u00e9f\u00e9rence d'un document se r\u00e9sout du particulier au g\u00e9n\u00e9ral et n'est JAMAIS stock\u00e9e : la cascade lit Type_doc et Zone au moment du calcul, donc un document d\u00e9plac\u00e9/retyp\u00e9 se reclasse automatiquement \u2014 stocker la valeur r\u00e9solue cr\u00e9erait des incoh\u00e9rences silencieuses \u00e0 maintenir.", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-28-charge-reference-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "specs_2026_08_28_charge_reference_design_ligne_charge", "label": "Ligne \u00ab Charge \u00bb du pane bas", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Sous la ligne Total : par mois visible, compare jours planifi\u00e9s (exactement le chiffre de la ligne Total, computeMonthTotalDays) et jours requis (charge r\u00e9partie) ; 3 couleurs (balanced/overload/partial) + cellule \u00ab non plac\u00e9 \u00bb pour les documents sans dates, jamais ignor\u00e9s.", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-28-charge-reference-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "specs_2026_08_28_charge_reference_design_plus_grand_reste", "label": "R\u00e9partition au plus grand reste", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Arrondi de chaque part mensuelle au 0,5 j inf\u00e9rieur puis distribution du reliquat par plus grand reste, pour que la somme des parts \u00e9gale exactement la charge du document \u2014 sans lui, arrondir chaque mois ind\u00e9pendamment ferait d\u00e9river le total de plusieurs jours.", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-28-charge-reference-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "specs_2026_08_28_charge_reference_design_spec", "target": "specs_2026_08_28_charge_reference_design_cascade_duree", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-28-charge-reference-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_08_28_charge_reference_design_spec", "target": "specs_2026_08_28_charge_reference_design_ligne_charge", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-28-charge-reference-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_08_28_charge_reference_design_spec", "target": "specs_2026_08_28_charge_reference_design_plus_grand_reste", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-28-charge-reference-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_08_28_charge_reference_design_spec", "target": "specs_2026_07_02_planning_synchro_design_table_planning_projet", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-28-charge-reference-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_08_28_charge_reference_design_spec", "target": "specs_2026_08_25_timesegment_mois_design_monthsegments", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-28-charge-reference-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_202